# expect.stdout: 6\n
# expect.exit: 0
project UserOpCallsUserOp
target console
runtime AgentRuntime 0.1
entry console main
error MainError
errorCase MainError Placeholder CSignedInt32

operation double
input operation double n CSignedInt64
output operation double Result CSignedInt64 Void
memory double heap no
async double no
purpose operation double "Return n * 2. Intentionally separate from the caller `tripleViaDouble` so the test exercises one user op invoking another."
invariant operation double "n is i64."
label startDouble
storage module immutable two CSignedInt64 2
call mulCall math.multiplyI64
argument mulCall left CSignedInt64 n
argument mulCall right CSignedInt64 two
run mulCall
bind value doubled CSignedInt64 mulCall
return ok doubled

operation tripleViaDouble
input operation tripleViaDouble n CSignedInt64
output operation tripleViaDouble Result CSignedInt64 Void
memory tripleViaDouble heap no
async tripleViaDouble no
purpose operation tripleViaDouble "Compute n * 3 by doing double(n) + n."
invariant operation tripleViaDouble "Exercises user-op call from inside another user op."
label startTriple
call doubleCall double
argument doubleCall n CSignedInt64 n
run doubleCall
bind ok doubledValue CSignedInt64 doubleCall
call sumCall math.addI64
argument sumCall left I64 doubledValue
argument sumCall right I64 n
run sumCall
bind value tripled CSignedInt64 sumCall
return ok tripled

operation main
input operation main console Console
output operation main Result ExitCode MainError
effect main write console.stdout
memory main heap no
async main no
purpose operation main "Verify tripleViaDouble(2) == 6, exercising nested user-op calls."
invariant operation main "Output should be 6."
label startMain
storage module immutable seed CSignedInt64 2
call tripleCall tripleViaDouble
argument tripleCall n CSignedInt64 seed
run tripleCall
bind ok tripledOutcome CSignedInt64 tripleCall
memory main mutable resultStorage I64 0
set memory resultStorage tripledOutcome
call writeCall console.writeIntegerLine
argument writeCall console Console console
argument writeCall value I64 resultStorage
run writeCall
ignore void source writeCall
storage module immutable successfulExitCode ExitCode 0
return ok successfulExitCode
